---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Reviews"
    preloads={["lora-latin.woff2", "lora-italic-latin.woff2", "roboto-400-latin.woff2"]}
    siteBase
    brandHref="#"
    bodyStyle="padding-top: 100px"
>

  

    <section class="text-center content-section">

      <h1 style="margin-bottom: 4%;"><b>Reviews</b></h1>
      <!-- <h3 style="font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 2.5%;"> Finge 2023 </h3> -->
      <div class="row ">
        <!-- 3rd quote -->
        <div class="col-md" style="margin-left: 2.5%; margin-right: 2.5%;">
            <figure class="bg-grey p-3 rounded" style="border-left: .5rem solid #ffffff;">
                <blockquote class="blockquote pb-2">
                  <p>
                    "Victoria Adler’s performance in her numerous roles is in such contrast to one another that it seems like she’s an entirely new person every time she comes onstage."</p><p> <b>"Her Macduff is practically award-winning;</b> a rather basic and forgettable character usually, Adler shows us the hell hath no fury beneath the character’s usual stoic manner."                      </p>
 

                </blockquote>
                <figcaption class="blockquote-footer mb-0 font-italic">
                    Katerina Partolina Schwartz, Perpper & Salt, 14th August 2024
                </figcaption>
                <a href="https://pepperandsalt.uk/2024/08/14/macbeth-sleep-no-more/" class="btn review grey darken-4" style="margin: 10px;">Read Review</a>
            </figure>

        </div>
    </div>
      <div class="row ">
          <!-- 2nd quote -->
          <div class="col-md" style="margin-left: 2.5%;">
              <figure class="bg-grey p-3 rounded" style="border-left: .6rem solid #ffffff;">
                  <blockquote class="blockquote pb-2">
                    <p>
                      "Victoria Adler (First Witch, Macduff and a very engaging Doctor) differentiates her main and subsidiary characters with great skill, subtle changes in posture and voice ensuring you know just who she is playing at what point."                      </p>
                    <p>
                      "The stage tension between Floyd and Adler was electric as they circled each other like a pair of prize fighters preparing to go the distance.  Verbally it was superb. Physically, it was breathtaking. Peerless."
                    </p>
                  </blockquote>
                  <figcaption class="blockquote-footer mb-0 font-italic">
                      Tim Wilcock, FringeReview, 9th August 2023
                  </figcaption>
                  <a href="http://fringereview.co.uk/review/edinburgh-fringe/2023/macbeth-sleep-no-more/" class="btn review grey darken-4" style="margin: 10px;">Read Review</a>
              </figure>

          </div>
          <div class="col-md" style=" margin-left: 2.5%; margin-right: 2.5%;">
              <!-- First quote -->
              <figure class="bg-grey p-3 rounded" style="border-left: .6rem solid #ffffff;">
                  <blockquote class="blockquote pb-2">
                    <p>
                      <br>
                      <br>
                      
                      "... but none shines brighter than Victoria Adler, who is scintillating in whichever body she is inhabiting. Adler’s sword fighting scene with Amy Floyd’s Macbeth is one of the highlights of the whole show..."
                      <br>
                      <br>
                      <br>
                      </p>
                  </blockquote>
                  <figcaption class="blockquote-footer mb-0 font-italic">
                      Greg Holstead, North West End UK, 10th August 2023 
                  </figcaption>
                  <a href="https://northwestend.com/macbeth-sleep-no-more-the-space-niddrie-street/" class="btn review grey darken-4" style="margin: 10px;">Read Review</a>
              </figure>
              
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row ">
            <!-- 4th quote -->
            <div class="col-md" style="margin-left: 2.5%;">
                <figure class="bg-grey p-3 rounded" style="border-left: .6rem solid #ffffff;">
                    <blockquote class="blockquote pb-2">
                      <p>
                        <br>
                        <br>
                        "Electrifying. The kind of energy Floyd and Victoria Adler (Macduff/Witch/others) bring to the climatic confrontation between Macbeth and Macduff merit that descriptor."
                        <br>
                        <br>

                        
                    </p>
    
                    </blockquote>
                    <figcaption class="blockquote-footer mb-0 font-italic">
                        Rebecca Mahar, All Edinburgh Theatre, 10th August 2024
                    </figcaption>
                    <a href="https://www.alledinburghtheatre.com/macbeth-sleep-no-more-shadow-road-productions-edfringe-2024-review/" class="btn review grey darken-4" style="margin: 10px;">Read Review</a>
                </figure>
  
            </div>
            <div class="col-md" style="margin-left: 2.5%; margin-right: 2.5%;">
                <!-- 5th quote -->
                <figure class="bg-grey p-3 rounded" style="border-left: .6rem solid #ffffff;">
                    <blockquote class="blockquote pb-2">
                      <p>
                        <br>
                        <br>
                        
                        "Highlights for me were Victoria Adler’s Doctor Livesey”
                        <br>
                        <br>
                        <br>
                        </p>
                    </blockquote>
                    <figcaption class="blockquote-footer mb-0 font-italic">
                        St Albans Times Issue 82, Pages 24-25, 21st August 2024 
                    </figcaption>
                    <a href="https://issuu.com/stalbanstimes/docs/st_albans_times_issue_82" class="btn review grey darken-4" style="margin: 10px;">Read Review</a>
                </figure>
                
              </div>
          </div>
         <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm ">
                <h3>Archery Coach Reviews 2025</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row ">
            <!-- first archery -->
            <div class="col-md">
                <figure class="bg-grey p-3 rounded" style="border-left: .5rem solid #ffffff;">
                    <blockquote class="blockquote pb-2">
                        <p>
                            I had a taster session with Victoria who was really engaging and broke everything down so well, truly a great coach, I'll definitely be coming back.
                        </p>
                    </blockquote>
                </figure>
                <figure class="bg-grey p-3 rounded" style="border-left: .5rem solid #ffffff;">
                    <blockquote class="blockquote pb-2">
                        <p>
                            The instructor victoria, was extremely helpful and very patient. Her explanation and instructions were clear and simple, big 👍 to victoria.
                        </p>
                    </blockquote>
                </figure>

            </div>
            <div class="col-md">
                
                <!-- second archery quote -->
                <figure class="bg-grey p-3 rounded" style="border-left: .5rem solid #ffffff;">
                    <blockquote class="blockquote pb-2">
                      <p>
                        Our instructor, Victoria, was incredibly enthusiastic and encouraging, making the class a lot of fun. She was also super funny, which made the challenging and detailed class even more enjoyable.
                    </p>
                    </blockquote>
                </figure>
                <figure class="bg-grey p-3 rounded" style="border-left: .5rem solid #ffffff;">
                    <blockquote class="blockquote pb-2">
                      <p>
                        Victoria was amazing!! Love her energy and enthusiasm.
                    </p>
                    </blockquote>
                </figure>

            </div>
           
        </div>
   




</section>
</BaseLayout>
